```

FAILING:
```
{"name": "execute", "parameters": {"request": ...}}
{"name": "read", "parameters": {"entity_ref": {"kind": "request", "id": "req-431b96"}}}
{"name": "write", "parameters": {"entity_ref": ..., "content": ..., "scope": ...}}
```

The failing calls have MORE nested content. Maybe the harness has problems with deeply-nested JSON in parameters? When my parameter is just `{"query": "x", "kind": "y"}` it works. When it has nested objects it fails.

Hmm. Let me try a minimal write with a single string content.
